lient library SDKs available to help developers build cognitive intelligence into applications without having direct artificial intelligence (AI) or data science skills or knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898059">Azure Cognitive Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2853567">Cognitive Services</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42351_2396187_2398653"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Hello feature gives business customers the fastest and most secure way to sign-in to Windows devices, apps and services. It uses your face, fingerprint or companion device to recognize you instantly, no password needed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396187">Windows Hello for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398653">Biznes uchun Windows Hello</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42352_2396192_2398645"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The gaming category where you can get clothing, weapons, tools or other useful items you can add to your game avatar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396192">Avatar items</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398645">Avatar elementlari</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42353_2396193_2398647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The game category with games that allow you to use your phone to interact with Xbox. You can browse and type on Xbox live using your phone instead of the controller.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396193">Companion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398647">Sherik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42354_2396194_2398652"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app category that offers utility apps which allow you to change settings and test network connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396194">Tools</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398652">Vositalar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42355_2396195_2398649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The game category that offers massively multiplayer online role-playing games. The users can choose a certain character and fight against other users on a map.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396195">Multi-player online battle arena</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2398649">Ko‘p o‘yinchili onlayn jang arenasi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4236_16880_2631459"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process an operating system uses to detect and record security-related events, such as an attempt to create, to access, or to delete objects such as files and directories. The records of such events are stored in a file known as a security log, whose contents are available only to those with the proper clearance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="16880">auditing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2631459">taftish</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42378_2396738_2405957"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office service that allows users to publish documents to Docs.com with one click from Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and Sway while retaining the original formatting and animation of the document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2396738">Publish to Docs.com</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405957">Docs.com xizmatiga joylash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42385_2397315_3037464"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azure workflow automation service designed to automate repetitive and time-consuming tasks by setting up a connection to access web services, files, or cloud-based data and put them to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397315">Microsoft Flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3037464">Power Automate</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42385_2701608_3037464"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Azure workflow automation service designed to automate repetitive and time-consuming tasks by setting up a connection to access web services, files, or cloud-based data and put them to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2701608">Flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3037464">Power Automate</term><termNote t