 that are read from left to right and characters that are read from right to left.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21066">bidirectional</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="469229">ikki tomonga qaratilgan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4239_211438_469229"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a mixture of characters that are read from left to right and characters that are read from right to left.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="211438">bidi</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="469229">ikki tomonga qaratilgan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42392_2397414_2405956"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Word Mobile feature that allows users to use ink on their mobile device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397414">Ink for phone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2405956">Qo‘lda yozish</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGen