 blue tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549985">Iceberg</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553868">Aysberg</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45152_2550010_2553871"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the green tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550010">Kelly</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553871">Yashil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45153_2550035_2553857"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the colors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550035">Brassy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553857">Temir</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45154_2550036_2553862"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a slightly rough and worn out quality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550036">Denim</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553862">Eskirgan</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45155_2550037_2553861"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which sharpens the image and keeps colors intact.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550037">Clean</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553861">Toza</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45156_2550038_2553858"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a muted, blue-green effect. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music. It evokes a subdued, cool, relaxed look and feel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550038">Chilled</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553858">Sovuq</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45157_2550041_2553864"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a feeling of energy, and the purple light you might see before an electrical storm. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550041">Electric</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553864">Elektrik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45158_2550043_2553877"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a golden brownish hue like sand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550043">Sandy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553877">Qumli</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45159_2550044_2553870"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a cheerful, playful, sunny feeling. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550044">Joy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553870">Quvnoq</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45160_2550045_2553859"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a yellow tone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550045">Citrus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2553859">Sarg‘ish</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45161_2550046_2553873"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which has a coarse texture and hard edges like metal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550046">Metallic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></la