>The security model that requires authentication and encryption of each access request as though it originates from an open network. Principles include segmentation, to make it harder for attackers to move through the network, and restricting user access to the minimum amount needed to do their job.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741343">Zero Trust</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2749651">Zero Trust</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4849_184188_1462357"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection of custom properties for a shape.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184188">shape data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1462357">shakl ma’lumoti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48494_2741547_2749630"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft cyber security center that is staffed with security professionals, data scientists, and product engineers who are available 24 hours, seven days a week to help protect, detect, and respond to threats in real-time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2741547">Cyber Defense Operations Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNot