 or connect to another respondent or another call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841644">agent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849393">chaqiruvlar uchun operator</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50217_2841650_2849396"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In a call queue, a method of sending calls to agents whereby routing of incoming calls is balanced so that each call agent gets the same number of calls from the queue.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841650">round robin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849396">davriy marshrutizatsiya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50218_2841689_2849395"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A representation of the network requirements for connecting Microsoft Teams and cloud voice across an organization's physical locations using network details, teams usage, sites and Microsoft recommended personas (office workers, remote workers, and Teams room system).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841689">network plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849395">tarmoq rejasi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50219_2841716_2849394"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of the Microsoft Teams Admin Center that shows detailed information about the devices, networks, and connectivity related to the calls and meetings for each user in a Microsoft Teams or Skype for Business tenant account. It is displayed on the user's Call History tab.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841716">Call Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849394">Chaqiruvlar tahlili</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50220_2841736_2849390"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Information that gives insight into usage patterns and activity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841736">analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849390">Tahlil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50221_2841755_2849391"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft teams, name of a tab on the Manage teams dialog that displays team analytics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841755">Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849391">tahlil</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50222_2841766_2849392"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In a call queue, a method of sending calls to agents whereby the first call in the queue rings all call agents at the same time. The first call agent to pick up the call gets the call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2841766">attendant routing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849392">operatorlar asosida marshrutizatsiya</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50231_2842090_2852420"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove marked-up documents or data from a machine learning system and from the training process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842090">unseed</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2852420">tozalash</term><termNote type="geographica