 capability that allows the user to boot directly to your Cloud PC.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054433">Windows 365 Boot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055897">Windows 365 Yuklash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53665_3054434_3055899"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows 365 capability that allows the user to swipe between desktop and a Cloud PC/Windows 365 environment as part of task view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3054434">Windows 365 Switch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055899">Windows 365 Almashtirish</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53668_3055383_3059675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to device features that can detect if someone is coming or going from a device, triggering the device to wake or lock.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3055383">presence sensing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="uz-Latn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3059675">harakat sensori</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">UZB</termNote